/E (Operating in a volatile context, The Free Shop Lebanon \(TFS\) faced common barriers in implementing cash and voucher assistance \(CVA\). The study reviews how TFS was able to structure its programme and operations to bring faster and more transparent aid delivery through their partnership with Boxtribute.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [10]
