/T (Where the system did not fully support field requirements, the team adopted a hybrid workflow: intake data captured through paper forms, WhatsApp exchanges, or printed templates, then transcribed into Google Sheets for structured review and bulk import. Google Forms were used in some instances to standardise intake before integration. These adaptations informed iterative system enhancements, including refinements to data fields, and led to Boxtribute piloting Google Sheet upload features with TFS.)
