/P 45 0 R
/T (The model transfers because it asks very little of the organisation adopting it. Onboarding was completed within five days, one staff member trained the rest, and the workflows continue to function through power cuts and unstable connectivity. The team has kept the shop open continuously for four years, including in 2024 with strikes landing within twenty minutes of the site, and again through the attacks of 2026.)
/E (The model transfers because it asks very little of the organisation adopting it. Onboarding was completed within five days, one staff member trained the rest, and the workflows continue to function through power cuts and unstable connectivity. The team has kept the shop open continuously for four years, including in 2024 with strikes landing within twenty minutes of the site, and again through the attacks of 2026.)
/Pg 15 0 R
