/Title (The Free Shop Lebanon was established in 2021, as a dignified distribution sub-project for Salam LADC, an NGO staffed primarily by international volunteers. With the intention of continuing the project under community leadership after their departure, the project lead registered TFS as a UK nonprofit to support the team in Lebanon's hyperinflationary economy while ensuring accountability through compliance with UK Charity Commission standards. Finding a simple, operational system that TFS could build around was critical in allowing them to:)
